WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:02,330
Hello

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,460
Sister-in-law, where is my brother Liu?

3
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,540
Are you really out of town?

4
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,540
Can you come and pick us up?

5
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,820
I really can't stay in room C anymore.

6
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,220
Sister Wang, you and Brother Liu haven’t left the city yet, right?

7
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,700
Please come back and take us out of the city.

8
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,620
This place is full of crazy people

9
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,140
It's terrible that they bite and eat people.

10
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:15,450
It's Lao Lu and his wife

11
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,680
Lao Lu, calm down and listen to me.

12
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,360
Hurry up and find a safe place with your wife and children.

13
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,280
Find something to eat and drink

14
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:22,320
Block the door

15
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,200
There will definitely be search and rescue personnel when the situation stabilizes.

16
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,560
Old brother doesn’t carry this kind of thing

17
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:28,160
At the same time, nearly ten years of friendship

18
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:30,000
You can't come back to save our family

19
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,000
You're so cold-blooded

20
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,240
This is to watch my whole family.

21
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,840
Die here. Are you still eating people?

22
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:38,100
I asked you to follow us last night and you refused to listen.

23
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:47,930
Is there anything I can do to apologize, Lao Lu?

24
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:49,930
I also have a wife and children

25
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:51,050
I can't take risks

26
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:52,730
Room C has been closed down

27
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:54,130
You can't go in even if you turn back.
